cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "Onepin Hard-Word Pronunciation Benchmark"
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-11-04
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Podonos (Onepin Research)"
    email: research@podonos.com
    website: https://onepin.ai
repository-code: https://github.com/onepinai/hard-word-benchmark
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - text-to-speech
  - pronunciation
  - proper nouns
  - benchmark
  - evaluation
abstract: >-
  How often 27 commercial text-to-speech models mispronounce 484 hard words in 100 US-English
  sentences, and how much Onepin's pronunciation check and correction fixes, scored sound by sound
  before and after correction. 2,700 clips, 13,068 hard-word readings, two phone recognisers as judges;
  100 sentences with their readings and 70 showcase clips released.
